WEBVTT

00:01.120 --> 00:02.520
I'm fine

00:10.440 --> 00:11.840
Still not leaving?

00:13.480 --> 00:15.480
Want me to see you out?

00:15.720 --> 00:16.760
Your Majesty, forgive me

00:16.840 --> 00:18.240
I'll leave now

00:21.520 --> 00:22.280
By the way

00:22.360 --> 00:23.640
There's one more thing

00:23.720 --> 00:25.120
Commissioned by Chancellor Xie

00:25.640 --> 00:28.240
Says there are state matters to discuss with Your Majesty

00:28.320 --> 00:30.320
Asked me to inform Your Majesty

00:38.640 --> 00:39.520
Your Majesty

00:39.600 --> 00:41.000
State affairs come first

00:44.600 --> 00:45.920
I know

00:46.000 --> 00:47.880
Have him wait for me at the Imperial Administration Palace

00:47.960 --> 00:49.080
Yes

